medy and edge-of-your-seat psychological thrillers, the <strong>2026 LHFF 3-Block Pass</strong> guarantees your seat for the entire afternoon short film marathon at a special bundled price.</p><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">\uD83D\uDCFD\uFE0F Included Screening Lineup:</h3><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>12:00 PM \u2014 Block 1: Twisted Visions &amp; Heart-Stopping Horror</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><em>Experimental, avant-garde, boundary-pushing horror combined with pure, visceral, traditional horror. Includes post-screening discussion.</em></p></li></ul></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>2:00 PM \u2014 Block 2: Dead Funny</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><em>Horror/Halloween comedy, dark humor, and delightfully twisted laughs.</em></p></li></ul></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>3:45 PM \u2014 Block 3: Mind Games</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><em>Psychological and tension-driven thrillers designed to mess with your head. Includes post-screening discussion.</em></p></li></ul></li></ul></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1791069661036_1933 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 2px;\n    \n      --tweak-text-block-stroke-color: hsla(var(--black-hsl), 1)\n;\n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1791069661036_1933 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1791069661036_1933 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      b