rong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><em>Horror/Halloween comedy, dark humor, and delightfully twisted laughs.</em></p></li></ul></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>3:45 PM \u2014 Block 3: Mind Games</strong></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><em>Psychological and tension-driven thrillers designed to mess with your head. Includes post-screening discussion.</em></p></li></ul></li></ul></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1791068850298_2651 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 2px;\n    \n      --tweak-text-block-stroke-color: hsla(var(--black-hsl), 1)\n;\n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1791068850298_2651 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1791068850298_2651 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1791068850298_2651 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1791068850298_2651 {\n      --tweak-text-block-blend\n  : normal;\n    }\n  \n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1791068850298_2651 {\n    --blur-value: blur(15px);}\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1791068850298_2651 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1791068850298_2651 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-vars\">\n  