</div></div></div>","excerpt":"<p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">This crisp biopic captures a complex character in the making as it charts one frenzied, formative year in the life of the American celebrity chef.</p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><em>Tony</em> focuses on Bourdain, as a 19-year-old who arrives in Provincetown, Mass. The future foodie finds himself working in a rowdy restaurant kitchen \"setting off a summer that will shape the course of his life.\"</p>","location":{"mapZoom":12.0,"mapLat":40.7207559,"mapLng":-74.00076130000002,"markerLat":40.7207559,"markerLng":-74.00076130000002,"addressTitle":"","addressLine1":"","addressLine2":"","addressCountry":""},"customContent":null,"likeCount":0,"commentCount":0,"publicCommentCount":0,"commentState":2,"unsaved":false,"fullUrl":"/now-playing/tony-ek747-b5ycl-29hn5-ewj32","assetUrl":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5ff89563cc0dcd7be5b5a538/1787914105892-HXSL0T1BYGMBTDNR6SL6/HHgwt2uWUAAEyql.jpg","contentType":"image/jpeg","structuredContent":{"_type":"CalendarEvent","startDate":1791148200572,"endDate":1791154500572},"startDate":1791148200572,"endDate":1791154500572,"items":[],"pushedServices":{},"pendingPushedServices":{},"originalSize":"1200x587","recordTypeLabel":"event"},{"id":"6abd9d4925d2bb7f543a3ee3","collectionId":"61e5f224b5857c262628f32d","recordType":12,"addedOn":1790812023260,"updatedOn":1791331005620,"starred":true,"passthrough":false,"tags":[],"categories":[],"workflowState":1,"publishOn":1790812023260,"authorId":"602eb52c9c36aa5e918c03b5","systemDataId":"1790811903068-P1TDIAMJ5KNWFHTV8API","systemDataVariants":"1280x720","systemDataSourceType":"JPG","filename":"maxresdefault (8).jpg","mediaFocalPoint":{"x":0.5,"y":0.5,"source":3},"colorData":{"topLeftAverage":"20323a","topRightAverage":"162226","bottomLeftAverage":"0b1015","bottomRightAverage":"0f1c24","centerAverage":"18262a","suggestedBgColor":"34444e"},"urlId":"american-doctor","title":"Fall of Freedom Weekend: American Doctor plus talk with Alexis Berends","sourceUrl":"","body":"<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6abd9d4925d2bb7f543a3ee3\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/45a223c2-0a7f-41e1-910b-7e4ed1931d30_973/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/45a223c2-0a7f-41e1-910b-7e4ed1931d30_973/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"135bb26c51eb10ce1e65\" id=\"block-135bb26c51eb10ce1e65\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Join us for a film and talk with Alexis Berends, International Peace and Conflict Resolution scholar.</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">From Emmy\u00AE Award-winning filmmaker Poh Si Teng, American Doctor follows three American physicians\u2014Palestinian, Jewish, and Zoroastrian\u2014united by a single oath to save lives. After volunteering in besieged hospitals in Gaza, they return home determined to fight for the patients and colleagues they left behind, taking their battle from the front lines of war to the halls of Congress.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Fall of Freedom Weekend</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Last fall, we activated a nationwide wave of creative resistance. Across the country, hundreds of galleries, museums, libraries, comedy clubs, theaters, schools, street corners and concert halls in almost every state hosted exhibitions, performances, and public events that channeled the urgency of this moment. Fall of Freedom's open invitation to artists, creators, and communities to take part showed the depth of talent and shared commitment to stand up to repression \u2014 and to celebrate the experiences, cultures, and identities that shape the fabric of our nation. 2026 lifted off with  the Fall Of Freedom on MayDay! and we're now building a dramatic expansion of arts activations across the country on October 2nd - 3rd - 4th: take part!&nbsp; Art matters, courage is contagious.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Rated NR, 1h33m</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iHepAlk0r2M\">Watch Trailer</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-135bb26c51eb10ce1e65 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-135bb26c51eb10ce1e65 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-135bb26c51eb10ce1e65 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-135bb26c51eb10ce1e65 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-135bb26c51eb10ce1e65 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-135bb26c51eb10ce1e65 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #b