he American celebrity chef.</p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><em>Tony</em> focuses on Bourdain, as a 19-year-old who arrives in Provincetown, Mass. The future foodie finds himself working in a rowdy restaurant kitchen \"setting off a summer that will shape the course of his life.\"</p>","location":{"mapZoom":12.0,"mapLat":40.7207559,"mapLng":-74.00076130000002,"markerLat":40.7207559,"markerLng":-74.00076130000002,"addressTitle":"","addressLine1":"","addressLine2":"","addressCountry":""},"customContent":null,"likeCount":0,"commentCount":0,"publicCommentCount":0,"commentState":2,"unsaved":false,"fullUrl":"/now-playing/tony-ek747-b5ycl-29hn5","assetUrl":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5ff89563cc0dcd7be5b5a538/1787914105892-HXSL0T1BYGMBTDNR6SL6/HHgwt2uWUAAEyql.jpg","contentType":"image/jpeg","structuredContent":{"_type":"CalendarEvent","startDate":1790535600572,"endDate":1790542200572},"startDate":1790535600572,"endDate":1790542200572,"items":[],"pushedServices":{},"pendingPushedServices":{},"originalSize":"1200x587","recordTypeLabel":"event"},{"id":"6ab2fb2f375e334a9b01703d","collectionId":"61e5f224b5857c262628f32d","recordType":12,"addedOn":1790115272254,"updatedOn":1790811246861,"starred":false,"passthrough":false,"tags":[],"categories":[],"workflowState":1,"publishOn":1790115272254,"authorId":"602eb52c9c36aa5e918c03b5","systemDataId":"1790115260393-1J2VFHS4TA66ZXPERFHO","systemDataVariants":"680x420","systemDataSourceType":"PNG","filename":"black zombie.png","mediaFocalPoint":{"x":0.5,"y":0.5,"source":3},"colorData":{"topLeftAverage":"131313","topRightAverage":"131313","bottomLeftAverage":"111111","bottomRightAverage":"0f0f0f","centerAverage":"151515","suggestedBgColor":"3d3b3a"},"urlId":"black-zombie","title":"Black Zombie","sourceUrl":"","body":"<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6ab2fb2f375e334a9b01703d\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/45a223c2-0a7f-41e1-910b-7e4ed1931d30_973/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/45a223c2-0a7f-41e1-910b-7e4ed1931d30_973/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"e36a9f81fbbb0400e856\" id=\"block-e36a9f81fbbb0400e856\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">BLACK ZOMBIE digs beneath the blood-soaked spectacle of modern horror to uncover the zombie's buried and unsettling origins. Long before it became associated with flesh-eating ghouls, the zombie was a living metaphor for slavery: not a monster, but the ultimate victim of colonial power. A symbol of stolen agency was recast as an object of fear, while Black spiritual traditions were distorted, sensationalized, and erased. Director Maya Annik Bedward traces the evolution of the zombie from colonial Haiti to contemporary Hollywood, reconsidering iconic films like WHITE ZOMBIE, NIGHT OF THE LIVING DEAD, and THE SERPENT AND THE RAINBOW alongside archival footage, v\u00E9rit\u00E9 scenes, and interviews with cultural historians, artists, and genre legends including Yves-Gr\u00E9gory Francois, Mambo Labelle D\u00E9esse, Slash, Tom Savini, and Zandash\u00E9 Brown. Part cultural reckoning, part horror remix, BLACK ZOMBIE exposes how a figure born from enslavement, spiritual belief, and resistance was transformed into one of pop culture's most profitable monsters. </p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Rated NR, 1h30m</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qxb3f3XumaE\">Watch Trailer</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-e36a9f81fbbb0400e856 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-e36a9f81fbbb0400e856 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-e36a9f81fbbb0400e856 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-e36a9f81fbbb0400e856 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-e36a9f81fbbb0400e856 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-e36a9f81fbbb0400e856 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-e36a9f81fbbb0400e856 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-button button-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/ea4eca2c-24a6-44e3-9a5c-84a0030cdb61_1143/website.components.button.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/ea4eca2c-24a6-44e3-9a5c-84a0030cdb61_1143/website.components.button.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.button\" data-sqsp-block=\"button\" data-website-component-id=\"c0df7af6a23b88139c2c\" id=\"block-c0df7af6a23b88139c2c\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n      \n      \n\n\n\n<div\n  class=\"sqs-block-button-container sqs-button-block-container-system_desktop sqs-block-button-container--right \"\n  data-animation-role=\"button\"\n  data-button-size=\"medium\"\n  data-button-type=\"primary\"\n  \n>\n  <a\n    href=\"https://ci.ovationtix.com/35991/production/1292350\"\n    class=\"sqs-block-button-element--medium sqs-button-element--primary sqs-block-button-element\"\n    data-sqsp-button\n    target=\"_blank\"\n  >\n    BUY TICKETS\n  </a>\n  \n\n\n\n</div>\n\n    \n  \n    \n    \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n<style>\n  #block-c0df7af6a23b88139c2c {\n    --sqs-block-content-flex: 0;\n  }\n\n  \n  \n    \n      \n      \n    \n      \n      \n        \n      \n    \n  \n</style>\n<style class=\"transform-vars\">\n    #block-c0df7af6a23b88139c2c {\n      --opacity: 100%;\n      --translate-x: 0px;\n      --translate-y: 0px;\n      --rotation: 0deg;\n      --scale-x: 100%;\n      --scale-y: 100%;\n      --skew-x: 0deg;\n      --skew-y: 0deg;\n      --origin-x: 50%;\n      --origin-y: 50%;\n      --block-transform: none;\n\n      opacity: var(--opacity, 1);\n      transform: var(--block-transform);\n      transform-origin: var(--origin-x) var(--origin-y);\n    }\n  </style><style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n</div></div></div></div></div>","excerpt":"<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">From Haitian resistance to Hollywood monsters: Unearth the true history of the zombie. Director Maya Annik Bedward traces the evolution of the zombie from colonial Haiti to contemporary Hollywood, reconsidering iconic films like WHITE ZOMBIE, NIGHT OF THE LIVING DEAD, and THE SERPENT AND THE RAINBOW alongside archival footage, v\u00E9rit\u00E9 scenes, and interviews with cultural historians, artists, and genre legends including Yves-Gr\u00E9gory Francois, Mambo Labelle D\u00E9esse, Slash, Tom Savini, and Zandash\u00E9 Brown. Part cultural reckoning, part horror remix, BLACK ZOMBIE exposes how a figure born from enslavement, spiritual belief, and resistance was transformed into one of pop culture's most profitable monsters.</p>","location":{"mapZoom":12.0,"mapLat":40.7207559,"mapLng":-74.00076130000002,"markerLat":40.7207559,"markerLng":-74.00076130000002,"addressTitle":"","addressLine1":"","addressLine2":"","addressCountry":""},"customContent":null,"likeCount":0,"commentCount":0,"publicCommentCount":0,"commentState":2,"unsaved":false,"fullUrl":"/now-playing/black-zombie","assetUrl":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5ff89563cc0dcd7be5b5a538/1790115260393-1J2VFHS4TA66ZXPERFHO/black+zombie.png","contentType":"image/png","structuredContent":{"_type":"CalendarEvent","startDate":1790466000453,"endDate":1790471400453},"startDate":1790466000453,"endDate":1790471400453,"items":[],"pushedServices":{},"pendingPushedServices":{},"originalSize":"680x420","recordTypeLabel":"event"},{"id":"6a987287e2243622f2b314c2","collectionId":"61e5f224b5857c262628f32d","recordType":12,"addedOn":1788375954649,"updatedOn":1790114607591,"starred":false,"passthrough":false,"tags":[],"categories":[],"workflowState":1,"publishOn":1788375954649,"authorId":"602eb52c9c36aa5e918c03b5","systemDataId":"1788375710536-X60H9HA51J1SWYDAMJ9T","systemDataVariants":"1178x1047","systemDataSourceType":"JPG","filename":"s-l1200.jpg","mediaFocalPoint":{"x":0.46085232903865214,"y":0.05595650703605126,"source":3},"colorData":{"topLeftAverage":"19181c","topRightAverage":"18191c","bottomLeftAverage":"ece8e5","bottomRightAverage":"c7c3bf","centerAverage":"19181d","suggestedBgColor":"584844"},"urlId":"pollock-with-carol-cruickshanks","title":"Pollock Plus Q&amp;A with Carol Cruickshanks ","sourceUrl":"","body":"<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6a987287e2243622f2b314c2\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/45a223c2-0a7f-41e1-910b-7e4ed1931d30_973/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/45a223c2-0a7f-41e1-910b-7e4ed1931d30_973/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"08dfe45a14caf43e7d1e\" id=\"block-08dfe45a14caf43e7d1e\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Stay for a post-screening talk with Carol Cruickshanks.</strong>&nbsp;Carol is a Michigan Scholar in College Teaching. Her career spans 40 years in a variety of venues in New England, Pennsylvania, 20 years with The College of New Jersey teaching Art History and Art Education. She is the Emerita Executive Director of New Hope Arts.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">About the Film: Ed Harris directs and stars as Jackson Pollock, the American painter whose radical drip technique redefined modern art \u2014 and whose life came apart almost as fast as his career took off.&nbsp; &nbsp;Marcia Gay Harden won an Oscar for her role as Lee Krasner, the fiercely devoted artist who saw Pollock's talent before the world did \u2014 and paid the price for loving him.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">The film traces Pollock's ascent from struggling artist to the face of a new American painting, without softening the alcoholism and self-destruction that ran alongside it. Harris spent years learning to paint in Pollock's style for the role, and the film's attention to craft \u2014 how the work actually got made \u2014 is one of its real strengths.A clear-eyed character study more than a conventional biopic.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Rated R, 2h2m</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IpFvHP18F6E\">Watch Trailer</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-08dfe45a14caf43e7d1e {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-08dfe45a14caf43e7d1e .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-08dfe45a14caf43e7d1e {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-08dfe45a14caf43e7d1e {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-08dfe45a14caf43e7d1e {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-08dfe45a14caf43e7d1e {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-08dfe45a14caf43e7d1e .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-button button-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/ea4eca2c-24a6-44e3-9a5c-84a0030cdb61_1143/website.components.button.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/ea4eca2c-24a6-44e3-9a5c-84a0030cdb61_1143/website.components.button.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.button\" data-sqsp-block=\"button\" data-website-component-id=\"ff67b2645e043ee07561\" id=\"block-ff67b2645e043ee07561\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n      \n      \n\n\n\n<div\n  class=\"sqs-block-button-container sqs-button-block-container-system_desktop sqs-block-button-container--right \"\n  data-animation-role=\"button\"\n  data-button-size=\"medium\"\n  data-button-type=\"primary\"\n  \n>\n  <a\n    href=\"https://ci.ovationtix.com/35991/production/1290809\"\n    class=\"sqs-block-button-element--medium sqs-button-element--primary sqs-block-button-element\"\n    data-sqsp-button\n    target=\"_blank\"\n  >\n    BUY TICKETS\n  </a>\n  \n\n\n\n</div>\n\n    \n  \n    \n    \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n<style>\n  #block-ff67b2645e043ee07561 {\n    --sqs-block-content-flex: 0;\n  }\n\n  \n  \n    \n      \n      \n    \n      \n      \n        \n      \n    \n  \n</style>\n<style class=\"transform-vars\">\n    #block-ff67b2645e043ee07561 {\n      --opacity: 100%;\n      --translate-x: 0px;\n      --translate-y: 0px;\n      --rotation: 0deg;\n      --scale-x: 100%;\n      --scale-y: 100%;\n      --skew-x: 0deg;\n      --skew-y: 0deg;\n      --origin-x: 50%;\n      --origin-y: 50%;\n      --block-transform: none;\n\n      opacity: var(--opacity, 1);\n      transform: var(--block-transform);\n      transform-origin: var(--origin-x) var(--origin-y);\n    }\n  </style><style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n</div></div></div></div></div>","excerpt":"<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Ed Harris directs and stars as Jackson Pollock, the American painter whose radical drip technique redefined modern art \u2014 and whose life came apart almost as fast as his career took off.&nbsp; &nbsp;Marcia Gay Harden won an Oscar for her role as Lee Krasner, the fiercely devoted artist who saw Pollock's talent before the world did \u2014 and paid the price for loving him.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Stay for a post-screening discussion with Carol Cruickshanks,. Her career spans 40 years in a variety of venues in New England, Pennsylvania, and 20 years with The College of New Jersey teaching Art History and Art Education. Her film presentations have become an Acme audience favorite!</p>","location":{"mapZoom":12.0,"mapLat":40.7207559,"mapLng":-74.00076130000002,"markerLat":40.7207559,"markerLng":-74.00076130000002,"addressTitle":"","addressLine1":"","addressLine2":"","addressCountry":""},"customContent":null,"likeCount":0,"commentCount":0,"publicCommentCount":0,"commentState":2,"unsaved":false,"fullUrl":"/now-playing/pollock-with-carol-cruickshanks","assetUrl":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5ff89563cc0dcd7be5b5a538/1788375710536-X60H9HA51J1SWYDAMJ9T/s-l1200.jpg","contentType":"image/jpeg","structuredContent":{"_type":"CalendarEvent","startDate":1790456400453,"endDate":1790464500453},"startDate":1790456400453,"endDate":1790464500453,"items":[],"pushedServices":{},"pendingPushedServices":{},"originalSize":"1178x1047","recordTypeLabel":"event"},{"id":"6aa86a6194f5416d1e100b28","collectionId":"61e5f224b5857c262628f32d","recordType":12,"addedOn":1789422207316,"updatedOn":1789422207532,"starred":false,"passthrough":false,"tags":[],"categories":[],"workflowState":1,"publishOn":1789422207316,"authorId":"602eb52c9c36aa5e918c03b5","systemDataId":"1740015286795-01Y6VX7DBAV