ervices":{},"seoData":{"seoTitle":"Tony","seoHidden":false},"originalSize":"1200x587","recordTypeLabel":"event"},{"id":"6a986e1ca232ae44c9e6723a","collectionId":"61e5f224b5857c262628f32d","recordType":12,"addedOn":1788374868446,"updatedOn":1788386305265,"starred":true,"passthrough":false,"tags":[],"categories":[],"workflowState":1,"publishOn":1788374868446,"authorId":"602eb52c9c36aa5e918c03b5","systemDataId":"1788374797744-T0EY64KP98J5AQ6KQ3EE","systemDataVariants":"1600x1174","systemDataSourceType":"JPG","filename":"$_57.jpg","mediaFocalPoint":{"x":0.5,"y":0.5,"source":3},"colorData":{"topLeftAverage":"4c4e59","topRightAverage":"1c1b1d","bottomLeftAverage":"1a1a1c","bottomRightAverage":"1d1c1f","centerAverage":"d2a685","suggestedBgColor":"3d3334"},"urlId":"foreign-fridays-naked","title":"Foreign Fridays: \"Naked\" Plus Discussion with Jason Caridi","sourceUrl":"","body":"<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6a986e1ca232ae44c9e6723a\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/45a223c2-0a7f-41e1-910b-7e4ed1931d30_973/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/45a223c2-0a7f-41e1-910b-7e4ed1931d30_973/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"93d3a3f9e0f3f190646a\" id=\"block-93d3a3f9e0f3f190646a\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong><em>Foreign Fridays monthly series</em></strong><em> will be hosted by Board Member, filmmaker, and travel lover, </em><strong><em>Jason Caridi</em></strong><em>. In addition to foreign films, the theme of this series will include those in which characters are in foreign places. The ways people interact with their novel surroundings is poetically tied in with how they interact with one another.<br><br>Our next film will be Mike Leigh's Naked. A drifter, sleazy yet charming, returns to his hometown of London to seek shelter and his intellectual match, all while fantasizing about the end of the world. Even Mike Leigh's bleakest film is still a working-class humanist marvel, equally difficult.&nbsp;</em><strong><em>Come for the film, stay for the discussion afterwards.</em></strong><em><br><br>We hope to see you there!</em></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-93d3a3f9e0f3f190646a {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-93d3a3f9e0f3f190646a .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-93d3a3f9e0f3f190646a {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-93d3a3f9e0f3f190646a {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-93d3a3f9e0f3f190646a {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-93d3a3f9e0f3f190646a {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-93d3a3f9e0f3f190646a .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-button button-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/ea4eca2c-24a6-44e3-9a5c-84a0030cdb61_1143/website.components.button.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/ea4eca2c-24a6-44e3-9a5c-84a0030cdb61_1143/website.components.button.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.button\" data-sqsp-block=\"button\" data-website-component-id=\"e89e587396c7da9e1a62\" id=\"block-e89e587396c7da9e1a62\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n      \n      \n\n\n\n<div\n  class=\"sqs-block-button-container sqs-button-block-container-system_desktop sqs-block-button-container--right \"\n  data-animation-role=\"button\"\n  data-button-size=\"medium\"\n  data-button-type=\"primary\"\n  \n>\n  <a\n    href=\"https://ci.ovationtix.com/35991/production/1290800\"\n    class=\"sqs-block-button-element--medium sqs-button-element--primary sqs-block-button-element\"\n    data-sqsp-button\n    target=\"_blank\"\n  >\n    BUY TICKETS\n  </a>\n  \n\n\n\n</div>\n\n    \n  \n    \n    \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n<style>\n  #block-e89e587396c7da9e1a62 {\n    --sqs-block-content-flex: 0;\n  }\n\n  \n  \n    \n      \n      \n    \n      \n      \n        \n      \n    \n  \n</style>\n<style class=\"transform-vars\">\n    #block-e89e587396c7da9e1a62 {\n      --opacity: 100%;\n      --translate-x: 0px;\n      --translate-y: 0px;\n      --rotation: 0deg;\n      --scale-x: 100%;\n      --scale-y: 100%;\n      --skew-x: 0deg;\n      --skew-y: 0deg;\n      --origin-x: 50%;\n      --origin-y: 50%;\n      --block-transform: none;\n\n      opacity: var(--opacity, 1);\n      transform: var(--block-transform);\n      transform-origin: var(--origin-x) var(--origin-y);\n    }\n  </style><style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n</div></div></div></div></div>","excerpt":"<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><em>We are continuing our monthly Foreign Fridays series on September 18th! This monthly series will be hosted by Board Member, filmmaker, and travel lover, Jason Caridi. </em></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><em>Our next film will be Mike Leigh's Naked. A drifter, sleazy yet charming, returns to his hometown of London to seek shelter and his intellectual match, all while fantasizing about the end of the world. Even Mike Leigh's bleakest film is still a working-class humanist marvel, equally difficult.&nbsp;</em><strong><em>Come for the film, stay for the discussion afterwards.</em></strong></p>","location":{"mapZoom":12.0,"mapLat":40.7207559,"mapLng":-74.00076130000002,"markerLat":40.7207559,"markerLng":-74.00076130000002,"addressTitle":"","addressLine1":"","addressLine2":"","addressCountry":""},"customContent":null,"likeCount":0,"commentCount":0,"publicCommentCount":0,"commentState":2,"unsaved":false,"fullUrl":"/now-playing/foreign-fridays-naked","assetUrl":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5ff89563cc0dcd7be5b5a538/1788374797744-T0EY64KP98J5AQ6KQ3EE/%24_57.jpg","contentType":"image/jpeg","structuredContent":{"_type":"CalendarEvent","startDate":1789772400572,"endDate":1789783200572},"startDate":1789772400572,"endDate":1789783200572,"items":[],"pushedServices":{},"pendingPushedServices":{},"originalSize":"1600x1174","recordTypeLabel":"event"},{"id":"6aa100a1361d183100bde06e","collectionId":"61e5f224b5857c262628f32d","recordType":12,"addedOn":1788988718396,"updatedOn":1788988718664,"starred":true,"passthrough":false,"tags":[],"categories":[],"workflowState":1,"publishOn":1788988718396,"authorId":"602eb52c9c36aa5e918c03b5","systemDataId":"1785887475896-8IZ287YZB8DMK1UWKQ5K","systemDataVariants":"1400x700","systemDataSourceType":"JPG","filename":"once.jpg","mediaFocalPoint":{"x":0.870833260672433,"y":0.16309520176478798,"source":3},"colorData":{"topLeftAverage":"6f603d","topRightAverage":"665a3a","bottomLeftAverage":"48462e","bottomRightAverage":"473e25","centerAverage":"030c0d","suggestedBgColor":"3a2f1d"},"urlId":"once-upon-a-time-in-a-cinema-blkwp-j9zna-ddf6m","title":"Once Upon a Time in a Cinema","sourceUrl":"","body":"<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6aa100a1361d183100bde06e\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/45a223c2-0a7f-41e1-910b-7e4ed1931d30_973/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/45a223c2-0a7f-41e1-910b-7e4ed1931d30_973/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"9c2220d34ed7172330a5\" id=\"block-9c2220d34ed7172330a5\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">ONCE UPON A TIME IN A CINEMA, a comedy-drama set in a small-town cinema during one eventful Friday night screening from hell. Over the course of one evening, the film follows the travails of beleaguered cinema owner Earl Clancy (Colin Morgan) as he faces a myriad of disasters, any one of which could sink him. Drawing from writer/director David Gleeson\u2019s own experience growing up in a family of cinema owners where his father\u2019s 78-year career marked the longest in the cinema business in Ireland, if not the world, ONCE UPON A TIME IN A CINEMA is a love letter to a peculiarly Irish cinema experience, which was as much about connecting with people as it was about the movie.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Rated NR, 1h32m</p><p class=\"sqsrte-small\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-A6qeJbwVSw\">Watch Trailer</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-9c2220d34ed7172330a5 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-9c2220d34ed7172330a5 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-9c2220d34ed7172330a5 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-9c2220d34ed7172330a5 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-9c2220d34ed7172330a5 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-9c2220d34ed7172330a5 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-9c2220d34ed7172330a5 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-button button-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/ea4