ative year in the life of the American celebrity chef.</p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><em>Tony</em> focuses on Bourdain, as a 19-year-old who arrives in Provincetown, Mass. The future foodie finds himself working in a rowdy restaurant kitchen \"setting off a summer that will shape the course of his life.\"</p>","location":{"mapZoom":12.0,"mapLat":40.7207559,"mapLng":-74.00076130000002,"markerLat":40.7207559,"markerLng":-74.00076130000002,"addressTitle":"","addressLine1":"","addressLine2":"","addressCountry":""},"customContent":null,"likeCount":0,"commentCount":0,"publicCommentCount":0,"commentState":2,"unsaved":false,"fullUrl":"/now-playing/tony","assetUrl":"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/5ff89563cc0dcd7be5b5a538/1787914105892-HXSL0T1BYGMBTDNR6SL6/HHgwt2uWUAAEyql.jpg","contentType":"image/jpeg","structuredContent":{"_type":"CalendarEvent","startDate":1788727500572,"endDate":1788733800572},"startDate":1788727500572,"endDate":1788733800572,"items":[],"pushedServices":{},"pendingPushedServices":{},"originalSize":"1200x587","recordTypeLabel":"event"},{"id":"6a91649a70d272587f18dd6d","collectionId":"61e5f224b5857c262628f32d","recordType":12,"addedOn":1787913592727,"updatedOn":1787913592890,"starred":true,"passthrough":false,"tags":[],"categories":[],"workflowState":1,"publishOn":1787913592727,"authorId":"602eb52c9c36aa5e918c03b5","systemDataId":"1787063769129-DKA45RLDW1DIOCWXJ33X","systemDataVariants":"640x480","systemDataSourceType":"JPG","filename":"sddefault.jpg","mediaFocalPoint":{"x":0.5,"y":0.5,"source":3},"colorData":{"topLeftAverage":"000000","topRightAverage":"000000","bottomLeftAverage":"000000","bottomRightAverage":"000000","centerAverage":"c9c6d2","suggestedBgColor":"70818d"},"urlId":"wild-inside-mg2ht","title":"Wild Inside","sourceUrl":"","body":"<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" id=\"item-6a91649a70d272587f18dd6d\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/45a223c2-0a7f-41e1-910b-7e4ed1931d30_973/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/45a223c2-0a7f-41e1-910b-7e4ed1931d30_973/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"7e7c22e54dbe011d3f8a\" id=\"block-7e7c22e54dbe011d3f8a\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">On February 2, 2023, Flaco -- a male Eurasian eagle-owl, the largest species of owl in the world -- was discovered missing from his cage at the Central Park Zoo in Manhattan. What follows when Flaco, who had lived his entire life in captivity, was released in New York City is a surprising story revealing the delight, concern, and fascination of millions in the city and beyond. </p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Rated NR, 1h36m</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iQGppfBgRMk\">Watch Trailer</a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-7e7c22e54dbe011d3f8a {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-7e7c22e54dbe011d3f8a .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-7e7c22e54dbe011d3f8a {\n      mix-blend-mode: